          "date": "2026-11-23 10:53:09.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20953 tests: wait for router forwarding in config_routes",
        "message": "LU-20953 tests: wait for router forwarding in config_routes\n\nconfig_routes() adds routes right after \"lnetctl set routing 1\".\nThe router only starts forwarding after alive_router_check_interval\n+ router_ping_timeout seconds (LU-15135), and until then its ping\nreplies tell the client that routing is off. The client then marks\nthe route down, so an immediate ping through the router fails\nwith -113, as seen in sanity-lnet test_238.\n\nWait for each router to report routing enabled before adding the\nroutes.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ied6153dcdf3a32c20337e3deccdbef4acdd64713\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Edit commit message"
    }
